    "The service reads the whole account's balance every 60 seconds. This page never queries it, and the value isn't today's estimated spend or one provider's balance.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "服务端每 60 秒读取一次整个账号的余额；本页不会触发查询，这个值不是今日估算花费，也不是某个 provider 的余额。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The service doesn't report an account balance.": {
